{"n":88,"ar":["هَلْ أَتَ\u003ctajweed class=madda_normal\u003eـٰ\u003c/tajweed\u003eكَ حَدِيثُ \u003ctajweed class=ham_wasl\u003eٱ\u003c/tajweed\u003eلْغَ\u003ctajweed class=madda_normal\u003eـٰ\u003c/tajweed\u003eشِيَةِ \u003cspan class=end\u003e١\u003c/span\u003e","وُجُو\u003ctajweed class=idgham_ghunnah\u003eهٌ ي\u003c/tajweed\u003eَوْمَئِذٍ خَ\u003ctajweed class=madda_normal\u003eـٰ\u003c/tajweed\u003eشِعَةٌ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٢\u003c/span\u003e","عَامِلَ\u003ctajweed class=idgham_ghunnah\u003eةٌ ن\u003c/tajweed\u003eَّاصِبَةٌ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٣\u003c/span\u003e","تَصْلَىٰ نَارًا حَامِيَةً \u003cspan class=end\u003e٤\u003c/span\u003e","تُسْقَىٰ مِنْ عَيْنٍ ءَانِيَةٍ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٥\u003c/span\u003e","لَّيْسَ لَهُمْ طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِ\u003ctajweed class=ikhafa\u003eن ض\u003c/tajweed\u003eَر\u003ctajweed class=madda_permissible\u003eِي\u003c/tajweed\u003eعٍ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٦\u003c/span\u003e","لَّا يُسْمِنُ وَلَا يُغْنِى مِ\u003ctajweed class=ikhafa\u003eن ج\u003c/tajweed\u003e\u003ctajweed class=madda_permissible\u003eُو\u003c/tajweed\u003eعٍ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٧\u003c/span\u003e","وُجُو\u003ctajweed class=idgham_ghunnah\u003eهٌ ي\u003c/tajweed\u003eَوْمَئِ\u003ctajweed class=idgham_ghunnah\u003eذٍ ن\u003c/tajweed\u003eَّاعِمَةٌ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٨\u003c/span\u003e","لِّسَعْيِهَا رَاضِيَةٌ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٩\u003c/span\u003e","فِى جَ\u003ctajweed class=ghunnah\u003eنّ\u003c/tajweed\u003eَةٍ عَالِيَةٍ \u003cspan class=end\u003e١٠\u003c/span\u003e","لَّا تَسْمَعُ فِيهَا لَ\u003ctajweed class=madda_normal\u003eـٰ\u003c/tajweed\u003eغِيَةً \u003cspan class=end\u003e١١\u003c/span\u003e","فِيهَا عَيْ\u003ctajweed class=ikhafa\u003eنٌ ج\u003c/tajweed\u003eَارِيَةٌ \u003cspan class=end\u003e١٢\u003c/span\u003e","فِيهَا سُرُ\u003ctajweed class=idgham_ghunnah\u003eرٌ م\u003c/tajweed\u003eَّرْفُوعَةٌ \u003cspan class=end\u003e١٣\u003c/span\u003e","وَأَكْوَا\u003ctajweed class=idgham_ghunnah\u003eبٌ م\u003c/tajweed